      "content": {
        "heading": "The Tug-of-War for Hydrogen",
        "bullets": [
          "Acid holds hydrogen like a handle",
          "Zinc is the stronger kid — it pulls hydrogen away",
          "Zinc sits ABOVE hydrogen in the reactivity series"
        ],
        "imageUrls": [
          "/images/zinc_displacing_hydrogen.jpg",
          "/images/zinc_hydrogen_tug_of_war.jpg"
        ]
      },
