      "content": {
        "heading": "2 Guides Before the Experiment",
        "bullets": [
          "Guide 1: an acid can give away hydrogen (H+)",
          "Guide 2: a metal above H in the reactivity series displaces it",
          "Zinc > H in the series → displacement guaranteed"
        ],
        "imageUrl": "/images/reactivity_series_chart.jpg"
      },
